---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../../components/StatusBadge.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Chongqing Night Drive | Small Car, Solved"
  description="An AI-generated LEAPMOTOR A10 concept in acid lime, electric violet and holographic silver, moving through Chongqing after dark."
  image="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/01.webp"
  alternatePath="/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/"
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" lang="en" />
  <article class="article-shell">
    <a class="article-back" href="/en/">← Back to home</a>
    <header class="article-head">
      <StatusBadge status="concept" lang="en" />
      <h1>Chongqing Night Drive</h1>
      <p class="article-summary">Going loud for the night. Acid lime, electric violet and holographic silver turn the LEAPMOTOR A10 into a future-facing city concept.</p>
      <p class="article-status-note"><strong>Current status:</strong> AI-generated concept visual. This is not an official colourway and not a production modification package.</p>
    </header>

    <img class="article-hero" src="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/01.webp" alt="Acid-lime, electric-violet and holographic-silver LEAPMOTOR A10 concept against Chongqing's Hongya Cave and Qiansimen Bridge at night" width="941" height="1672" />

    <div class="article-body">
      <h2>Going loud for the night</h2>
      <p>This concept deliberately avoids restraint. Acid lime leads the front half, electric violet anchors the rear, and a holographic-silver cut runs through the body. The wheel arches, aero blades, turbine wheels and transparent active wing are pushed in the same direction.</p>
      <p>Chongqing supplies the scale: Hongya Cave and Qiansimen Bridge open the set, Huangjuewan Interchange carries the speed, Liziba places a still car against a moving monorail, and Sujiaba's spiral road closes the night.</p>

      <h2>Five views of Chongqing after dark</h2>
      <div class="concept-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/02.webp" width="941" height="1672" loading="lazy" alt="Acid-lime and electric-violet LEAPMOTOR A10 concept in a high-speed tracking shot through Huangjuewan Interchange" />
          <figcaption>Huangjuewan: spinning wheels, layered ramps and directional city light.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/03.webp" width="941" height="1672" loading="lazy" alt="Acid-lime and electric-violet LEAPMOTOR A10 concept parked at Liziba as the monorail passes through the building" />
          <figcaption>Liziba: the car stands still while the city keeps moving.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/04.webp" width="941" height="1672" loading="lazy" alt="Three detail views of the LEAPMOTOR A10 concept's colour split, pixel lighting, turbine wheel and transparent aero parts" />
          <figcaption>Future details: colour blocking, pixel light blade, turbine wheel and transparent aero.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/solutions/a10-chongqing-night/05.webp" width="941" height="1672" loading="lazy" alt="Acid-lime and electric-violet LEAPMOTOR A10 concept driving through Chongqing's Sujiaba spiral interchange at night" />
          <figcaption>Sujiaba: one last spiral through the city before the night runs out.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2>Concept boundaries</h2>
      <p>Every image on this page is an <strong>AI-generated concept visual</strong>. The colour blocking and exaggerated aerodynamic parts are not an official colourway, not a production modification package, and not evidence of confirmed fitment, road legality or safety.</p>
      <p>The page presents a visual direction for the LEAPMOTOR A10 in Chongqing. It does not claim that a real vehicle has been modified to this specification.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>
